SUMMARY:AI Hacks & Hops: Taking Agentic AI to the next level with Hermes
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Taking Agentic AI to the next level with
  Hermes**\n**Speaker:** [Jared Lucas](https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaredclu
 cas/)\n\n**Description:**\nIf you’ve used Claude Cowork\, you already kn
 ow how useful an AI collaborator can be inside a project. This session sho
 ws what comes next: Hermes as a broader agent operating system\, where age
 nts can use tools\, share memory\, run scheduled work\, coordinate through
  Kanban\, and take on real workflows beyond a single chat window. We’ll 
 cover the basic concepts and show practical examples of what becomes possi
 ble.\n\n**Special discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\nYour paid ticke
 t gets you $10 off our 5th anniversary with our customized [ADN Pirani cup
 s](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-m
 ugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can select yours di
 rectly at this event.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a mo
 nthly event tailored for non-technical professionals\, entrepreneurs\, mar
 keters\, engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore and discuss how to use
  AI.\n\nEach gathering will feature presentations\, stimulating group disc
 ussions\, and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite brews while 
 delving into the world of AI. Topics will range from AI integration in bus
 iness processes\, marketing\, content creation\, software\, ethical consid
 erations\, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to the latest advancements 
 in AI technology. The informal setting encourages open dialogue\, idea exc
 hange\, and fosters a collaborative spirit.
