SUMMARY:Curated Conversations
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHello Nomads!! For our next exciting Curat
 ed Conversations\, we will be meeting at the wonderful venue\, Day Trip do
 wntown. Once there\, take a moment to adjust to the **impeccable** **1970s
  groovy decor** and soak it in before ordering a beverage (adult or otherw
 ise). Then\, join us in the large room\, where we will begin our latest in
 stallment of Curated Conversations sharing and discussing podcasts\, books
 \, and advice we've heard and read on various subjects related to **dating
  and communication** (including some funny examples).\n\nWe will explore *
 *resources that speak to the importance of strong communication** as it pe
 rtains to dating and building healthy relationships. We invite you to **br
 ing the book(s) and/or names of podcast series or episodes** that were mos
 t impactful for you\, so others can consider how it may be useful for them
 . Don't worry\, any books you bring will go home with you! We'll share the
 m during the meeting and provide a list of all the resources shared after.
 \n\nLook for the Digital Nomads table and group of welcoming people where 
 the AVL Digital Nomad signage will be. Fill out a name tag to make introdu
 ctions easier and begin engaging with the other single remote workers.\n\n
 Bring a single friend or two who may be interested in meeting new people a
 nd **leveling up their communication skills in fun and creative ways. This
  isn't matchmaking:** it's learning communication skills to empower you fo
 r maximizing your own connections. See you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315272553/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T164657Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T164657Z
